{"id":"76ff789378ca2b77","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-hif-low2-basis.md","title":"超免疫自由且 low₂ 的基","display":"thm-hif-low2-basis — 超免疫自由且 low₂ 的基","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-hif-low2-basis","aliases":["20-thm-hif-low2-basis"],"display":"thm-hif-low2-basis — 超免疫自由且 low₂ 的基","chapter":"9","section":"9.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 9.5.1（展开构造与 Tot 核验）","source_printed_pages":[178,179],"source_pdf_pages":[210,211],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-thm-relative-tot-complete]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-hif-low2-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-hif-low2-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hif-low2-basis — 超免疫自由且 low₂ 的基"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.5.1（展开构造与 Tot 核验）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>178</span><span>179</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>210</span><span>211</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c8c6546a7f5a867\" href=\"?note=3c8c6546a7f5a867\" title=\"20-thm-relative-tot-complete\">20-thm-relative-tot-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=[T]\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(C=[T]\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是可计算树。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3c8c6546a7f5a867\" href=\"?note=3c8c6546a7f5a867\" title=\"20-thm-relative-tot-complete\">20-thm-relative-tot-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-low2-basis}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(X))\\land\\operatorname{Low}_2(X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-low2-basis}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(X))\\land\\operatorname{Low}_2(X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>构造嵌套无限可计算树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0=T\\supseteq T_1\\supseteq\\cdots\">\\(T_0=T\\supseteq T_1\\supseteq\\cdots\\)</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_e\">\\(T_e\\)</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{e,x}=\\{\\sigma\\in T_e:\\Phi_{e,|\\sigma|}^{\\sigma}(x)\\uparrow\\}\">\\(U_{e,x}=\\{\\sigma\\in T_e:\\Phi_{e,|\\sigma|}^{\\sigma}(x)\\uparrow\\}\\)</span>；采用随长度递增的有限时限，它向下闭合。问题“存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{e,x}\">\\(U_{e,x}\\)</span> 无限”是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2^0\">\\(\\Sigma_2^0\\)</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\prime\\)</span> 判定。有则保留该发散子树；无则保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_e\">\\(T_e\\)</span>，迫使泛函在每条剩余路径上全定义。紧致性给交中路径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。每个全定义决定都由构造记录读出，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tot}^X\\le_T0\\prime\\prime\">\\(\\mathrm{Tot}^X\\le_T0\\prime\\prime\\)</span>，进而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\prime\\prime\\equiv_T0\\prime\\prime\">\\(X\\prime\\prime\\equiv_T0\\prime\\prime\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=\\Phi_e^X\">\\(h=\\Phi_e^X\\)</span> 全定义，则每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{e,x}\">\\(U_{e,x}\\)</span> 有限；有效搜索空层，取该层所有节点的停止输出最大值，得到普通可计算函数逐点支配 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>。树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_e\">\\(T_e\\)</span> 的索引对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 可作为有限常数，求各个支配函数无需统一 oracle。这里的 Low₂ 使用任意集合上的谓词。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 9.5.1（展开构造与 Tot 核验）；印刷页 178, 179；PDF 第 210, 211 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n<p>续修说明：嵌套非空闭类的共同路径存在性直接使用 Cantor 紧致性；0″ 只选择可计算树的索引，不意味着共同路径可由这些索引统一可计算地选择。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-tot-complete","status":"resolved","id":"3c8c6546a7f5a867","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-tot-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-cantor-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"84785d7ea3ad1a08","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"